{"2068080": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "NEOTAG LEAGUE", "steam_appid": 2068080, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up, <strong>step into the arena</strong> , and prepare for heart-pumping battles as you <strong>fight for the ball</strong> in thrilling online matches!   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>✦NEOTAG LEAGUE✦</strong> is a <strong>physics-based futuristic ball sport game</strong>, where two <strong>parkour robots</strong> teams compete in an arena.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This sport is a mix of parkour and football (soccer).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⊲ PVP MATCHES ⊳</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its fast-paced gameplay and thrilling team-based PVP matches, NEOTAG LEAGUE will put your skills to the ultimate test. Master all parkour mechanics (jump, dash, roll, wall run, grapple) to outplay your opponents and win the match! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against an opponent in a 1v1 duel, or join a team to play 2v2 or 3v3 matches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⊲ SOLO MODE ⊳</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve your movement skills in intense single player levels. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to push your parkour game to the limit to break the track records in this 'Time Attack' gameplay!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⊲ MORE INFO ⊳</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The project started in September 2021, and I'm working solo on it. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game was released in Early Access on January 2025, and then (finally) released in 1.0 on March 2026</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Team up, <strong>step into the arena</strong> , and prepare for heart-pumping battles as you <strong>fight for the ball</strong> in thrilling online matches!   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>✦NEOTAG LEAGUE✦</strong> is a <strong>physics-based futuristic ball sport game</strong>, where two <strong>parkour robots</strong> teams compete in an arena.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This sport is a mix of parkour and football (soccer).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⊲ PVP MATCHES ⊳</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its fast-paced gameplay and thrilling team-based PVP matches, NEOTAG LEAGUE will put your skills to the ultimate test. Master all parkour mechanics (jump, dash, roll, wall run, grapple) to outplay your opponents and win the match! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against an opponent in a 1v1 duel, or join a team to play 2v2 or 3v3 matches.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⊲ SOLO MODE ⊳</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Improve your movement skills in intense single player levels. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try to push your parkour game to the limit to break the track records in this 'Time Attack' gameplay!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⊲ MORE INFO ⊳</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The project started in September 2021, and I'm working solo on it. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game was released in Early Access on January 2025, and then (finally) released in 1.0 on March 2026</p>", "short_description": "Team up and beat your opponents in NEOTAG LEAGUE, the futuristic sport where sci-fi parkour robots fight for the ball to score points! Jump, roll, wall run, grapple, dodge and attack in this team-based multiplayer game.", "supported_languages": "English, French", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068080/a895ff7230fffc33773d87b518b380415dbf9847/header.jpg?t=1774795361", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2068080/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774795361", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/